OL,3,GNEWSADrought measures sought due to low
OL,4,Areservoir levels
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome 43,000 properties are at "threat
OL,7,Fof a serious deficiency" of water
OL,8,Fsupplies after levels from the local
OL,9,Freservoir dropped to their lowest since
OL,10,F2011, South East Water (SEW) has said.
OL,12,FThe Arlington reservoir near Polegate
OL,13,Fis currently 38.4% full, prompting the
OL,14,Fwater company to apply to the
OL,15,FEnvironment Agency (EA) for a drought
OL,16,Fpermit.
OL,18,FIf granted, this would allow SEW to
OL,19,Fincrease the amount of water it takes
OL,20,Ffrom the River Cuckmere during times of
OL,21,F"suitable flow conditions".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
