OL,3,GNEWSADrought measures sought due to low
OL,4,Areservoir levels
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter the South East experienced its
OL,7,Fdriest April to September in over a
OL,8,Fcentury, SEW pointed to an "exceptional
OL,9,Fshortage of rainfall" across the River
OL,10,FCuckmere catchment during 2026.
